flowchart LR
  SRC[Source / Package / Model / Skill] --> PIN[Pin Revision + Digest]
  PIN --> LICENSE[License + NOTICE Review]
  PIN --> SECURITY[Secrets + Vulnerability Scan]
  PIN --> PROVENANCE[Provenance + Build Verification]
  LICENSE --> APPROVAL[Human Approval Register]
  SECURITY --> APPROVAL
  PROVENANCE --> APPROVAL
  APPROVAL --> SBOM[SPDX / CycloneDX SBOM]
  SBOM --> RELEASE[Release Artifact + Notices]
  RELEASE --> AUDIT[Archive Evidence + Exceptions]
